    - Never skip hooks (--no-verify) or bypass signing (--no-gpg-sign, -c commit.gpgsign=false) unless the user has explicitly asked for it. If a hook fails, investigate and fix the underlying issue.`}var Eao=["dangerouslyDisableSandbox"],KMn=[...Eao,"run_in_background"];
