var oYt="ListConnectors",alo="List the MCP connectors installed for the user's claude.ai org, optionally filtered by keyword.",llo=`List the MCP connectors installed for the user's claude.ai org. Call this when the user asks what connectors they have. Pass keywords to filter to a topic; omit to list all.

