Do NOT call this if the suggestion is not relevant, you are unsure it would help, or you already rendered one this conversation and the user did not engage.`,we=`Render an inline card of plugins the user can add to claude.ai, taken from ${SXe} results. The card handles all install UI; do not describe the plugins in text.

